          "mildness",
          "brevity",
          "absence",
          "weakness"
        ],
        "answer_index": 0,
        "explanation": "Despite 提示转折，后句「escaped with only minor damage」与风暴的猛烈形成对比；ferocity「猛烈」符合；mildness/brevity/absence/weakness 与 despite 转折不符。"
      }
    },
    {
